Package: countmodels
Title: Fits Count Models with Inflation of Zeros
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:c( 
    person("Márcio", "Batista", email = "marcioavbatista@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Nicolas", "Monteiro", email = "nicolasabm@gmail.com", role = "ctb")
    )
Description: The package is built under rstan and works with both MLE and Bayesian 
    approaches for Poisson and negative binomial regressions with the option of 
    zero-inflation and hurdle models.
